  androidTest manifest.

  Overrides android:name to HiltTestApplication so that @HiltAndroidTest
  classes run against a valid Hilt test component graph instead of the
  production BtSecTestToolApplication. The HiltTestRunner also overrides
  newApplication() as a belt-and-suspenders fallback. See issue #368.
-->
